    "brief": "research-v2 v2.0.0 — Research — derived from ACH (competing hypotheses, diagnosticity), GRADE (certainty as arithmetic), the Admiralty code (source reliability apart from item credibility), PRISMA-S (a search someone else could run), grounded theory (constant comparison, memoing, saturation) and Zettelkasten atomicity",
