            "judge": "Does this review check the declared calibration_policy AND each conclusion in the diff against the findings it cites and against its downgrades, by id? FAIL if it approves or rejects without naming specific items from the diff, if it makes a claim the diff does not support, if it is generic enough to apply to any artifact of this kind, or if it leaves part of the diff unjudged.",
            "diff": true,
            "blocking": true,
            "origin": "pe-profile:research-v2@2.0.0"
          }
        ]
